<title>ROMANIA: TENNIS-BELGIUM LEAD ROMANIA 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BELGIUM LEAD ROMANIA 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium led Romania 2-1 in their Davis Cup World group qualifying tie on Saturday.</p>
<p>Results: (Romanian names first)</p>
<p>Andrei Pavel beat Filip Dewulf 6-1 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Doubles:</p>
<p>George Cozac/Dinu Pescariu lost to Dewulf/Libor Pimek 6-4 0-6 2-6 4-6</p>
